  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Privatisation of state-owned banks in the Federation, BiH. The goal isto continue activities started by dutch consultants in 1998-1999. Two long-term and a number of short-term specialised consultants are financed. The project is initiated and co-ordinated by the World Bank.A similar project is implemented in the RS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Privatisering av banker i Federationen BiH. M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att forts&#xE4;tta denprivatiseringsprocess som p&#xE5;b&#xF6;rjats av holl&#xE4;ndska konsulter under 1998- 1999. Tv&#xE5; l&#xE5;ngtidskonsulter och ett antal specialiserade korttids- konsulter finansieras. Projektet &#xE4;r initierat och samordnat av V&#xE4;rlds-banken. Ett liknande projekt genomf&#xF6;rs i RS.</narrative>
  </description>
